  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.31 - Correctness and code-fix hardening from an adversarial analyzer audit\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM001 now flags same-width signed/unsigned numeric mismatches (e.g. uint to int) that C# has no implicit conversion for\n            - Generated code fixes escape C# keyword property names (e.g. @class) so they compile\n            - AM020 nested CreateMap fixes emit namespace-qualified, generic-aware type names\n            - AM003 element conversion casts are gated on a safe implicit conversion instead of a speculative cast\n            - AM031 detects ValueTask<T>.Result synchronous access; AM006/AM041/AM050 and shared helpers hardened\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (818 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Codex review passing per change\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.30 - Add AM021 immutable and frozen collection fixes",
